# Emeritus of Conflict: "Whenever you cast your third spell each turn, this creature becomes prepared" (CR 603.2, 722.3a). On
# turn 1 it is cast as Bot1's third spell, but it is not on the battlefield then, so it is not prepared. On turn 3 two Moxen
# are spells one and two (still unprepared), Lightning Bolt from hand is the third and prepares it, and the copy of Lightning
# Bolt cast from exile (CR 722.3c) is the fourth spell: it unprepares the creature, and the fourth spell prepares nothing again.

